{"schema_version":"0.1.0","template":{"template_id":"storyo.bio-tragic-loop","title":"Bio-Tragic Loop","template_kind":"macro_narrative_skeleton","scale":"macro","source_file":"docs/user-frameworks/MODULAR_STORY.txt","source_sha256":"4a4422f31b8683a0d9b7e64a29bf815b81e579ac52ebe89cbb148226923022bf","elements":[{"element_id":"foundation","kind":"layer","label":"Foundation Layer: Context & Polarities"},{"element_id":"incubation","kind":"layer","label":"Incubation Layer: Desire & Transgression"},{"element_id":"transformation","kind":"layer","label":"Transformation Layer: Inversion Point"},{"element_id":"collapse","kind":"layer","label":"Collapse Layer: Recognition & Mirroring"},{"element_id":"synthesis","kind":"layer","label":"Synthesis Layer: Absorption & Recoding"},{"element_id":"domain_of_stability","kind":"phase","label":"Domain of Stability","layer_id":"foundation","description":"A world or institution with internal moral logic. The protagonist is embedded here, fluent but restless. Local tension already exists between preservation and progress."},{"element_id":"invading_element","kind":"phase","label":"Invading Element","layer_id":"foundation","description":"A newcomer, discovery, or technology challenges the existing equilibrium. Intent is ambiguous: redemptive, seductive, or efficient. The protagonist first reacts with curiosity mixed with resistance."},{"element_id":"attraction_phase","kind":"phase","label":"Attraction Phase","layer_id":"incubation","description":"The protagonist finds in the Invader a solution to an unacknowledged void. Emotional or intellectual intimacy builds around shared technical or moral language. Boundaries (professional, ethical, emotional) begin dissolving."},{"element_id":"confession_phase","kind":"phase","label":"Confession Phase","layer_id":"incubation","description":"Hidden trauma, guilt, or an unfinished past emerges. The Invader offers reinterpretation of that wound through their own paradigm. Each enables the other’s self-deception."},{"element_id":"crossing_threshold","kind":"phase","label":"Crossing the Threshold","layer_id":"transformation","description":"The protagonist abandons prior loyalties (family, ethics, craft, etc.) for the Invader’s world and becomes immersed in its system or ideology through training, initiation, or demonstration."},{"element_id":"revelatory_scene","kind":"phase","label":"Revelatory Scene","layer_id":"transformation","description":"The Invader’s true ambition, method, or creation is unveiled. The revelation fuses the personal with the systemic: love and ideology become one organism. Awe and revulsion coexist."},{"element_id":"return_of_the_past","kind":"phase","label":"Return of the Past","layer_id":"collapse","description":"A figure, creation, or consequence re-enters to expose the underlying pattern. This element mirrors the protagonist or Invader in corrupted form."},{"element_id":"moral_entropy","kind":"phase","label":"Moral Entropy","layer_id":"collapse","description":"Social, emotional, or material systems begin to break down. Attempts at restitution only propagate the contagion."},{"element_id":"resolution_by_absorption","kind":"phase","label":"Resolution by Absorption","layer_id":"synthesis","description":"Institutions or systems integrate the outcome as policy, industry, or norm. The personal tragedy becomes infrastructure."},{"element_id":"frame_or_coda","kind":"phase","label":"Frame or Coda","layer_id":"synthesis","description":"The protagonist or a witness recounts events from a context where the horror has been normalized. What once seemed aberrant is now résumé material, curriculum, or doctrine."},{"element_id":"protagonist","kind":"variable_node","label":"Protagonist","description":"Carrier of conscience or memory","reconfiguration_question":"What value do they unconsciously protect?"},{"element_id":"invader","kind":"variable_node","label":"Invader","description":"Catalyst, mirror, or teacher","reconfiguration_question":"What alternative system do they represent?"},{"element_id":"system","kind":"variable_node","label":"System","description":"Contextual authority","reconfiguration_question":"What defines “normal” here?"},{"element_id":"wound","kind":"variable_node","label":"Wound","description":"Latent contradiction","reconfiguration_question":"What past failure primes the protagonist for seduction?"},{"element_id":"creation_proof","kind":"variable_node","label":"Creation / Proof","description":"Tangible manifestation of ideology","reconfiguration_question":"What materializes the theme?"},{"element_id":"mirror_figure","kind":"variable_node","label":"Mirror Figure","description":"Returns consequence to sender","reconfiguration_question":"What form does self-recognition take?"},{"element_id":"frame","kind":"variable_node","label":"Frame","description":"Aftermath or normalization","reconfiguration_question":"Who retells the story, and under whose authority?"},{"element_id":"abstract_flow_1","kind":"abstract_flow_beat","label":"Equilibrium (A within System)","order":1},{"element_id":"abstract_flow_2","kind":"abstract_flow_beat","label":"Disruption (Invader enters)","order":2},{"element_id":"abstract_flow_3","kind":"abstract_flow_beat","label":"Attraction → Partnership","order":3},{"element_id":"abstract_flow_4","kind":"abstract_flow_beat","label":"Confession / Exposure","order":4},{"element_id":"abstract_flow_5","kind":"abstract_flow_beat","label":"Initiation into Invader paradigm","order":5},{"element_id":"abstract_flow_6","kind":"abstract_flow_beat","label":"Revelation of creation or proof","order":6},{"element_id":"abstract_flow_7","kind":"abstract_flow_beat","label":"Collapse / Mirror","order":7},{"element_id":"abstract_flow_8","kind":"abstract_flow_beat","label":"Absorption","order":8},{"element_id":"abstract_flow_9","kind":"abstract_flow_beat","label":"Irony / Frame","order":9},{"element_id":"emotional_spine_1","kind":"emotional_spine_beat","label":"Desire","order":1},{"element_id":"emotional_spine_2",